Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["ValidateEvolutionConfiguration", "ObjectName",
 CellID->796015863,ExpressionUUID->"38aca3ae-1cca-fd4b-88cd-22352146b133"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"4c246fea-888d-3642-86ba-b49107151f2c"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["ValidateEvolutionConfiguration",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->
     "paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/ref/\
ValidateEvolutionConfiguration"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "assoc", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8cd7dba3-94af-654b-9f0c-b5e84a7fa1d7"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the normalized configuration for the \
[StructureAdaptiveEvolution](paclet:SamuelFrerichs/StructureAdaptiveEvolution/\
ref/StructureAdaptiveEvolution) settings in the association ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["assoc", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "b570436f-e43e-fa44-aba3-db4d8f9271c5"],
 ", or a Failure that names the first invalid setting."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->816112178,ExpressionUUID->"42a7b15a-29e2-ab48-9d95-819ac89d93cd"],

Cell["\<\
Missing settings take the defaults in Options[StructureAdaptiveEvolution]. \
The normalized configuration resolves the goal preset into mutation \
strategies and fitness metrics, merges evolution limits with the default \
limits, normalizes symmetry groups and records the canonical-form backend \
(always \"Exact\" in the declared universe).\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->947171108,ExpressionUUID->"20763f98-2603-644f-969f-565d729cafc2"],

Cell["\<\
Selecting a strategy adds the metrics it requires. Metric overrides and \
custom metrics join the selected metrics. Unknown strategy or metric names, \
malformed limits, a Target constraint without a \"Tolerance\" and a numeric \
Maximize or Minimize constraint without a \"Threshold\" are rejected.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->610249690,ExpressionUUID->"f471f462-16fa-b848-8e50-a8457909a6fc"]
}, Open  ]],

